        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "IBC stablecoin expansion",
          "why": "Native USDC and USDY launching on Noble showed that institutional-grade dollar liquidity was finally entering Cosmos, resolving a long-standing gap versus EVM chains."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "ICF governance and leadership crisis",
          "why": "A no-confidence vote over fund mismanagement and a co-founder's North Korea security allegations pointed to deep structural trust problems at the protocol's core steward."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Interchain infrastructure consolidation",
          "why": "ICF acquiring Skip and Cosmos Labs absorbing Mintscan raised concentration alarms — the supposedly decentralized stack was quietly being recentralized under a few entities."
